Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2.2: start the app with the verified Orbium organism
 and its parameter set

- add simulation/startup.js: plans the start (Orbium + its params, or the old noise start with a note when the URL is incompatible)
- App takes the initial state instead of hardcoding the noise seed
- main.js builds the plan inside the existing error handling
- tests: 9 new unit tests
